{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OL兼アイドルの新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木どこ？、\n見ていただけたでしょうか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OLの設定を利用して\nリアルな夏恋を妄想してみました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は青春ものや\n幼馴染系とか\n何個か妄想してたんだけど、\n私が学生の妄想をするより、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"社会人の恋愛を妄想した方が\n面白いかな？って思って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はビアガーデンの妄想を\nしてみました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃からTVっ子で\nトレンディードラマの再放送や\n未来日記(懐かしい←)\n恋するハニカミ\nあいのり等の\n恋愛バラエティー見ていたので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これらを参考にしつつ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先輩OLや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"社会人になったばかりの\n大学時代の友達(OL)の話を聞き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妄想を膨らませてました←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出来はどうだったでしょうか？←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は上司の奈々男さんが\nカッコよ過ぎて\n楽しく演技が出来ました←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週の次回予告のVTRに\n映ってなかったから\nてっきりカットされたのかと\n思ってましたが、\n放送されて嬉しいです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/18/7127426/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また企画があったら\nやりたいなー(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------------------------------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/18/7127426/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国ツアー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は、\n全国ツアー初日in大阪でしたっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに全員で挑んだライブ。\n最高に楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年まではあまり見れなかった\n推しタオルや\n名前の入った団扇。\nそして青のサイリウム。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きな会場でも\n見つけられて本当に\n嬉しかったです(T_T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブの経験も\n上手く活かせるように\n頑張りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでも、やっぱり\nまだまだだなと課題も\nたくさん見つかりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場が大きい分、\n奥の席の方にはどうしたら\n一緒に盛り上がれるか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モニターで抜かれなくても\n(良い意味で)新内だっ！と\n見つけられるようにするには\nどうしたらいいか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"などなど、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46が一丸となって\n全国へお邪魔します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれた皆さんには\n絶対後悔させたくない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しんで貰いたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その一心で残りの公演も\n頑張っていきたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも喝を入れてくれる\n生駒さんや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アドバイスをくれる\n松井さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから来る人は\n楽しみにしてて下さいね(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この夏一番の思い出にしましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/18/7127426/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/18/7127426/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ直後の私。\n顔より身体に汗をかく派です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-----------------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/18/7127426/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パリ最終回公開中です(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非ご覧下さいっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/18/7127426/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/18/7127426/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パリ4～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週は\nキャンプ会っっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\nかりんちゃん初登場っ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎週金曜日公開中ですので、\nよろしくお願いします(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\n今日はこの辺で"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/08/18/7127426/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お盆明けの満員電車が辛い。からの投稿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また書きます(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"}],"source":"archive"}